cicada 2
// cicada-continuity-test: disposable fixture
title "Studio continuity regression"
tempo 120
key c minor
track keys acid { cutoff=700Hz }
  
pattern continuity notes steps=64 { 1 . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . c4 }
pattern alternate notes steps=64 { 5 . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . c4 }
scene main { keys=continuity }
scene alternate { keys=alternate }
song { main*999 }
